## Приложение А. Матрица FSM (Lifecycle × Operating Modes)

| Lifecycle \ Mode | NOMINAL | ISOLATED | RECOVERY |
|---|---|---|---|
| **BOOT** | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **BOOT_FAILSAFE** | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| **SELF_TEST** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| **RUNNING** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **DEGRADED** | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **SHUTDOWN** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

